WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.900
They could take your AI away.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.800
What if more of that power
belonged to us?

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.100
Our vision for AIPSTER:

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.900
peer-to-peer AI inference across personal meshes,

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.200
sharing compute and GPUs—less dependence on any single provider.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:26.300
Experimental recursive self-improvement, designed to optimize routing and inference.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:33.900
Don't let the data centers be the only
ones that have the power to compute.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.900
AI is for everyone.
